{
  "info": {
    "name": "Dapr Workflow Service - Legacy LLM Integration",
    "description": "Legacy API collection for testing Dapr Workflow Service.\n\n**NOTE:** Use 'Dapr AI Loan Workflow - Complete API Collection' for the latest comprehensive collection.\n\n## Prerequisites\n1. Groq API key configured (or Ollama for local testing)\n2. Dapr application running on port 8081\n3. Dapr sidecar running on port 3500\n\n## Start Application\n```bash\ndapr run --app-id loan-agent-service --app-port 8081 --dapr-http-port 3500 --resources-path ./dapr/components -- .\\gradlew.bat bootRun\n```",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "LLM Endpoints",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Test LLM Connection",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8081/api/llm/test",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8081",
              "path": ["api", "llm", "test"]
            },
            "description": "Test if Ollama LLM is connected and responding.\n\nExpected Response:\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"SUCCESS\",\n  \"model\": \"qwen2.5:3b\",\n  \"response\": \"Hello! Ollama is working!\"\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify Document (AI Agent)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"applicantName\": \"Rahul Sharma\",\n  \"documentType\": \"PAN Card\",\n  \"details\": \"ABCDE1234F, issued 2020\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8081/api/llm/verify-document",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8081",
              "path": ["api", "llm", "verify-document"]
            },
            "description": "AI Agent analyzes a document and returns verification result.\n\nExpected Response:\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"SUCCESS\",\n  \"model\": \"qwen2.5:3b\",\n  \"analysis\": \"... AI analysis with isValid, confidence, recommendation ...\"\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify Document - Aadhaar Card",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"applicantName\": \"Priya Patel\",\n  \"documentType\": \"Aadhaar Card\",\n  \"details\": \"1234-5678-9012, Address: Mumbai, DOB: 1990-05-15\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8081/api/llm/verify-document",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8081",
              "path": ["api", "llm", "verify-document"]
            },
            "description": "Verify Aadhaar Card document using AI Agent."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify Document - Income Proof",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"applicantName\": \"Amit Kumar\",\n  \"documentType\": \"Salary Slip\",\n  \"details\": \"Company: TCS, Monthly Salary: Rs. 85,000, Month: November 2024, Employee ID: TCS12345\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8081/api/llm/verify-document",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8081",
              "path": ["api", "llm", "verify-document"]
            },
            "description": "Verify Income Proof (Salary Slip) document using AI Agent."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Dapr Sidecar Endpoints",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Test LLM via Dapr Sidecar",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:3500/v1.0/invoke/dapr-workflow-service/method/api/llm/test",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "3500",
              "path": ["v1.0", "invoke", "dapr-workflow-service", "method", "api", "llm", "test"]
            },
            "description": "Test LLM connection via Dapr service invocation.\n\nThis calls the app through Dapr sidecar, enabling:\n- Service discovery\n- Retry policies\n- Observability"
          },
          "response": []
        },
